  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c152579e-680b-4ffd-bce2-4638c6073dfd.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><strong>將所有植物放入花盆中。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><em>曾經好奇為什麼有些植物無法放入花盆嗎？</em> <em>現在就可以囉！</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li>此模組新增了 <strong>94</strong><strong> </strong>種這些植物的花盆版本 <em>（適用於 v1.5）</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">若要相容於&nbsp;<strong>Farmer's Delight</strong>，請見：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/potted-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Potted Delight</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><br>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1120989/description_c397814b-9f65-4d0c-84c8-f7e4219f8b61.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"494\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1120989/description_f382af73-89b8-418e-b911-7b19a6231855.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"565\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>",
